---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<article class="post">
  <div class="post-inner">
    <p class="post-eyebrow"><a href="/blog/">&larr; All articles</a></p>
    <h1 class="post-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    {#- No published date on display. These are evergreen explainers, so a date only makes them look
        stale later — and it is the one thing that would show several posts going out the same day.
        The real date stays in each post's front matter, so ordering still works and nothing is faked. #}
    <p class="post-meta">406 Front Desk &middot; Kalispell, Montana</p>
    <div class="post-body">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </div>
    <div class="post-cta">
      <p>See what a 24/7 AI receptionist would do for your business.</p>
      <div class="post-cta-btns">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/demo/">Try the Live Demo</a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="/contact/">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
